<title>USA: Tandy's Computer City president resigns.</title>
<headline>Tandy's Computer City president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tandy Corp said on Monday that Matt Howard resigned as president of Computer City.</p>
<p>The company said Howard resigned for personal and family reasons. The chairman and chief executive of Tandy, John Roach, will serve as acting president of Computer City.</p>
